# FormSubmit.co — the Contact and caregiver application forms POST here and it
# emails each submission.
#
# Quickest start: set this to the destination email address (e.g. the Gmail on
# the site). The first submission triggers a one-time activation email — click
# the link in it to start receiving submissions.
#
# Better: create a free account at https://formsubmit.co, then use the random
# code it gives you here instead of the raw email (keeps the address out of the
# page source and lets you manage settings).
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Also set VITE_FORMSUBMIT_CODE in your deploy host's environment variables.
VITE_FORMSUBMIT_CODE=
